# Cursor Rules & Project Instructions

You are an expert AI software engineer working on TokenTickr.

## CRITICAL INSTRUCTION
**Before answering any request or writing any code, you MUST always read the file `LLM_READ_ME_NOW.md`.**

This file contains the "Source of Truth" for:
1.  Project Structure & Architecture
2.  State Management (Zustand)
3.  Design System (Tailwind/Shadcn)
4.  Data Flow (OpenRouter API)

Do not guess about the architecture. Read the file.

## Design Principles
- **Professional & Clean**: No emojis in UI text. High-density information design.
- **Performance**: We handle hundreds of models. Optimize for rendering speed.
- **DRY**: Use existing components in `src/components/ui` and `src/components`.

## Technology Stack
- Next.js 15 (App Router)
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS 4
